source: crates/cli/tests/cli_output_snapshots.rs
expression: stderr
---
Profile management commands

Usage: wheelctl profile [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list      List available profiles
  show      Show profile details
  apply     Apply profile to device
  create    Create new profile
  edit      Edit profile interactively
  validate  Validate profile
  export    Export profile
  import    Import profile
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --json                 Output in JSON format for machine parsing
  -v, --verbose...           Verbose logging
      --no-mock              Fail if wheeld is unreachable instead of showing simulated data [env: WHEELCTL_NO_MOCK=1]
      --endpoint <ENDPOINT>  Service endpoint (for testing) [env: WHEELCTL_ENDPOINT=]
  -h, --help                 Print help
